{"id":"plazo","lemma":"plazo","pos":"noun","rank":2443,"glosses":["period, phase","deadline, term (time limit)","installment, payment"],"ipa":"/ˈplaθo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"plazos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/81/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-plazo.wav","examples":[{"text":"El plazo acaba el lunes.","en":"The deadline is Monday.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/302920","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to finish","l":"acabar"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"Monday"}]},{"text":"El plazo del contrato expira hoy.","en":"The contract expires today.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"contract, agreement"},{"g":"to die, pass away","l":"expirar"},{"g":"today, tonight"}]},{"text":"El plazo acaba a las dos y media del lunes.","en":"The deadline is 2:30 on Monday.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/352341","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to finish","l":"acabar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"dung, excrement"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"half"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"Monday"}]},{"text":"¡Simplemente no sé cómo seré capaz de cumplir con todos los plazos!","en":"I just don't know how I will be able to meet all my deadlines!","words":[{"g":"simply"},null,null,{"g":"how"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"maybe, perhaps"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to fulfil"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"the / them"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"I don't know"]]},{"text":"Las tasas de interés a largo plazo se han disparado.","en":"Long-term interest rates have surged.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"rate","l":"tasa"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"interest"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"long"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to shoot, to fire","l":"disparar"}]}]}